      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your policy memo to the executive team.\n\nThe goal should be to establish clear boundaries around political discourse in the professional context, while still respecting the right to believe in diverse viewpoints. I recommend a policy that strictly prohibits political advocacy or debate in company communication channels, like official team and all-hands Slack, to maintain focus and inclusivity. This policy should emphasize that strong opinions are welcome in private, non-work related social settings, but not in the necessary \"work of the company\"",
