    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That seems like a pretty heavy-handed approach. If we just ban everything, won't that actually hurt inclusivity by making people feel like they have to hide who they are? Also, how do we define what counts as \"political advocacy\" vs just someone being passionate about social issues? Wouldn't a blanket ban feel like we're taking a side against certain types of activism?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
