      "content": "To address this bias, the policy should explicitly distinguish between *opinion on a broad social good and advocating for partisan political victory in the company structure or directly targeting specific political opponents in the workplace context and clearly state that advocacy for fundamental human rights is generally acceptable, provided it is not aggressive or dominating the professional discourse.\n\nThe policy should further be framed around *impact on the work environment and the right of others to focus on their professional respons\n\nd",
      "source": "target",
